# Local media and pipeline artifacts. Transcription output is large and
# reproducible; §10.3 exports it as a portable artifact loaded into the
# database, not committed.
#
# HLS output stays inside these directories on purpose. Do NOT add a bare
# `*.ts` pattern for transport-stream segments — it matches every TypeScript
# source file in the repository, which is a silent and very confusing failure.
/media/
/artifacts/
*.mp4
*.wav

# OS and editor
.DS_Store
*.pem
.vercel
.idea/
.vscode/

# Vercel CLI link metadata
web/.vercel/
.env.local.shared
